1HTWtXU3ZC?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"Ciena 的 Openreach 交易：1.6Tb/s 技術能否推動其成長？"},{"title":"Can AT&T's U.S. Fiber Expansion Deal With GIP & CPP Boost the Stock?","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOSkNZWmJhdWZmRGg5Ui10ajRoQWM0RG9sRTJOSzlOXzcwMzRUZXR5MVhGVzZyeGw4RDZpOF9YeGtpaXlFaFVYU3lYVGI2X1ltYzZUcWpPNzFfZ3hMTjhjNkc3NXphOXk0bjlJekRkSmV5Q21YMFJYcjdMS2tRRl9mLXJlZ1A3MmhDU09uS0NSeUk4My1oSmRTSzRZVUMyZWx5WEVnUnFBOHBaVGlUYjR4bEtoLVdfVTlBcGk4?oc=5","date":"2026-10-07","zh":"AT&T 的美國光纖擴張計畫與 GIP 和 CPP 能否提振股價？"},{"title":"Corning and AT&T's $3 Billion Fiber Deal Reveals Where AI Spending Goes Next","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-02","zh":"康寧和 AT&T 價值 30 億美元的光纖交易揭示了人工智慧支出的下一步走向"},{"title":"Can Corning's AT&T Deal Boost Its Optical Communications Growth?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxORzBUX3dhV042OS1JQ0hsdlV3X3VmUnZSZGdQQm9yUEUta25uaFRuUU11alQ1ODZxb3lWcUV0bmNoaDJZbFVNTzZ5aEQtVlc0Ymt0SFNpRzRST01CVi0tMHROMmxLcUdqSEtpel9kX2ZYdXdBY01Hd0s3cmM2ZE4xa0VKMHdYeVcwbzU3Zk9ZTTVwbHNV?oc=5","date":"2026-10-01","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/24741/000002474126000124/glw-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Corning traces its origins to a glass business established in 1851. The present corporation was incorporated in the State of New York in December 1936. The Company's name was changed from Corning Glass Works to Corning Incorporated on April 28, 1989.","zh":"康寧公司的起源可以追溯到 1851 年成立的玻璃企業。現在的公司於 1936 年 12 月在紐約州註冊成立。 1989 年 4 月 28 日，公司名稱從康寧玻璃廠更名為康寧公司。"},{"en":"Corning is vital to progress – in the industries we help advance and in the world we share. With a 175-year track record of life-changing inventions, Corning applies its unparalleled expertise in glass science, ceramic science and optical physics, along with its deep manufacturing and engineering capabilities to develop category-defining products that transform industries and enhance people's lives. Our materials science and manufacturing expertise, boundless curiosity and commitment to purposeful invention place us at the center of the way the world works, learns and lives. In addition, our sustained investment in research, development and engineering capabilities means we are always ready to solve the toughest challenges alongside our customers.","zh":"康寧對於進步至關重要——在我們幫助推動的行業和我們共享的世界中。康寧擁有 175 年改變生活發明的記錄，運用其在玻璃科學、陶瓷科學和光學物理方面無與倫比的專業知識以及深厚的製造和工程能力，開發出能夠改變行業並改善人們生活的類別定義產品。我們的材料科學和製造專業知識、無限的好奇心以及對有目的的發明的承諾使我們處於世界工作、學習和生活方式的中心。此外，我們對研究、開發和工程能力的持續投資意味著我們隨時準備好與客戶一起解決最嚴峻的挑戰。"},{"en":"Our capabilities are versatile and synergistic, allowing Corning to evolve to meet changing market needs, while also helping customers capture new opportunities in dynamic industries. Today, Corning's markets include optical communications, display, mobile consumer electronics, automotive, life sciences, semiconductors and solar. Corning's industry-leading products include damage-resistant cover materials for mobile devices; precision glass for advanced displays; optical fiber, cable and connectivity solutions for advanced communications networks, such as fiber to the home and data centers, enabling artificial intelligence and connections around the world; trusted products to accelerate drug discovery and delivery; and clean-air technologies and technical glass for cars and trucks.","zh":"我們的能力具有多功能性和協同性，使康寧能夠不斷發展以滿足不斷變化的市場需求，同時幫助客戶在充滿活力的行業中抓住新的機會。如今，康寧的市場包括光通訊、顯示器、行動消費性電子產品、汽車、生命科學、半導體和太陽能。康寧業界領先的產品包括用於行動裝置的防損壞覆蓋材料；用於高級顯示器的精密玻璃；用於先進通訊網路的光纖、電纜和連接解決方案，例如光纖到戶和資料中心，實現人工智慧和世界各地的連接；值得信賴的產品，可加速藥物發現和交付；以及汽車和卡車的清潔空氣技術和技術玻璃。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Corning is guided by an enduring set of Values that defines our relationship with employees, customers and our communities: Quality, Integrity, Performance, Leadership, Innovation, Independence and the Individual. Our Values are the key to our business success, a source of pride and excitement for our employees and the factor that ultimately sets us apart from our competitors. In short, we believe that how we do things is as important as what we do. We measure how we live our Values through our annual \"Voice to Action\" Workplace Culture Survey. In 2025, we had an 87% response rate with survey participation worldwide. We use the results to pinpoint recurring global themes and develop plans to drive action based on employee feedback.","zh":"康寧以一套持久的價值觀為指導，定義了我們與員工、客戶和社區的關係：品質、誠信、績效、領導、創新、獨立和個人。我們的價值觀是我們業務成功的關鍵，是我們員工自豪和興奮的源泉，也是我們最終從競爭對手中脫穎而出的因素。簡而言之，我們相信我們做事的方式與我們所做的事情同樣重要。我們透過年度「行動之聲」工作場所文化調查來衡量我們如何實踐我們的價值觀。 2025 年，我們在全球的調查參與率達到了 87%。我們利用這些結果來確定反覆出現的全球主題，並根據員工回饋制定計劃以推動行動。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with many large and varied manufacturers, both domestic and foreign. Some of these competitors are larger than we are, and some have broader product lines. We strive to maintain and improve our market position through technology and product innovation. For the foreseeable future, our competitive advantage lies in our commitment to research and development, deep customer relationships, reliability of supply, product quality, superior customer service and technical specification of our products. There is no assurance that we will be able to maintain or improve our market position or competitive advantage.","zh":"我們與國內外許多大型多元化製造商競爭。這些競爭對手中有一些比我們規模更大，有一些擁有更廣泛的產品線。我們努力透過技術和產品創新來維持和提高我們的市場地位。在可預見的未來，我們的競爭優勢在於我們對研發的承諾、深厚的客戶關係、供應的可靠性、產品品質、卓越的客戶服務和產品的技術規格。無法保證我們能夠維持或提高我們的市場地位或競爭優勢。"},{"en":"We maintain a leadership position in the segment's principal product groups, which include carrier and enterprise networks. The competitive landscape includes industry consolidation, pricing pressure and competition for the innovation of new products. These competitive conditions are likely to persist. Our large-scale manufacturing experience, fiber process, technology leadership and intellectual property provide cost advantages relative to several of our competitors. Our principal competitors include Amphenol, Fujikura and their subsidiary America Fujikura Ltd., Sumitomo and Prysmian Group S.p.A.","zh":"我們在該領域的主要產品組（包括營運商和企業網路）中保持領先地位。競爭格局包括產業整合、定價壓力以及新產品創新的競爭。這些競爭狀況可能會持續下去。相對於我們的幾個競爭對手，我們的大規模製造經驗、纖維製程、技術領先地位和智慧財產權提供了成本優勢。我們的主要競爭對手包括安費諾、藤倉及其子公司美國藤倉有限公司、住友及普睿司曼集團 S.p.A."}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Optical Communications","val":6274000000,"zh":"光通訊"},{"name":"Display Products","val":2965000000,"zh":"展示產品"},{"name":"Specialty Materials Products","val":2194000000,"zh":"特殊材料產品"},{"name":"Automotive Products","val":1777000000,"zh":"汽車產品"},{"name":"Life Science Products","val":959000000,"zh":"生命科學產品"},{"name":"Polycrystalline Silicon Products","val":955000000,"zh":"多晶矽產品"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":505000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":15629000000}},"peers":["CIEN","AMAT","MRVL","TXN","QCOM"]}}